class_name InteriorRoom
extends NyeMap
## A small room the student steps into from one of the nye maps - the inside of
## the lhakhang, the lakeside shrine, or the dzong.
##
## It behaves exactly like a nye: the student arrives where the doorway that
## brought them in said they would, and the camera is clamped to the room.
## Every room has one opening in its south wall leading back out.
